---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Online Florist Singapore" description="How Online Florist Singapore handles personal information submitted through the website." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <section class="section"><div class="shell" style="max-width:760px">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1 style="font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,68px)">Privacy notice</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-top:42px">Information we collect</h2>
    <p>When you send an enquiry, we collect the contact, occasion, delivery, message, and attribution details shown in the form. We also retain a one-way hash of the request address for short-term abuse prevention; the raw address is not stored in the enquiry database.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-top:42px">How it is used</h2>
    <p>The information is used to assess and respond to your enquiry, plan requested delivery details, prevent repeated automated submissions, and understand which pages led to enquiries. It is not sold.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;margin-top:42px">Retention and requests</h2>
    <p>Enquiry records should be retained only for customer service and operational needs. Contact details for privacy requests will be published here before the site accepts live enquiries.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
